      <h1>WhatsApp Channels Major Update: 60-Sec Video Notes, Voice Transcripts & QR Codes</h1>
      <div class="article-meta">
        <span>By <a href="/about" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;">Nazim · Social Ninja's</a></span><span>·</span><span>Sep 22, 2026</span><span>·</span><span>5 min read</span>
      </div>
      <p class="article-intro">Meta has deployed its largest feature update for WhatsApp Channels since launch. Channel admins can now broadcast circular video notes, followers can read automatic voice note transcripts, and unique QR codes make offline subscriber growth easier than ever.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="prose">

      <div class="callout">
        <strong>🚀 Growth Tip:</strong> Want to turn physical foot traffic into loyal Channel subscribers? Convert your channel link into a custom branded QR code flyer using <a href="/">LinkWA's free QR Studio</a>.
      </div>

      <h2>1. 60-Second Video Notes (Direct from Admins)</h2>
      <p>Following the massive success of circular video messages in one-on-one chats, WhatsApp has brought <strong>Video Notes to Channels</strong>. This feature transforms how creators and brands interact with their community:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Authentic Behind-the-Scenes Updates:</strong> Admins can record quick, candid 60-second video snippets directly inside the app without needing studio production or editing software.</li>
        <li><strong>Circular, Autoplaying Format:</strong> Video notes play automatically on mute when a follower scrolls past, driving dramatically higher engagement and click-through rates.</li>
        <li><strong>Spontaneous Product Teasers:</strong> E-commerce brands can show a quick unboxing, fabric preview, or flash sale announcement in seconds.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>2. Automatic Voice Message Transcripts</h2>
      <p>Voice notes are one of WhatsApp's most popular features, but followers often cannot listen to audio when they are at work, in class, or commuting on transit.</p>
      <p>With this update, <strong>WhatsApp automatically generates accurate text transcripts beneath voice updates</strong>. Transcripts are generated locally on the device to maintain privacy, and followers can simply read along without plugging in headphones.</p>

      <h2>3. Built-In QR Code Discovery for Channels</h2>
      <p>Until recently, inviting people to a channel required sharing a raw link (e.g. <code>whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaXXXXX</code>). Now, WhatsApp allows admins to instantly display a scannable QR code directly on their phone screen.</p>
      <p>This is especially powerful for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>In-person networking events and conferences.</li>
        <li>Retail store checkout counters.</li>
        <li>Podcasts and live streaming events where viewers can scan the screen.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Why Custom Branded QR Codes Still Win</h2>
      <p>While the native in-app QR code is handy for quick sharing between phones, professional marketing requires branded assets. Standard black-and-white QR codes often look generic and have lower scan rates.</p>
      <p>By taking your channel link and plugging it into <a href="/">LinkWA</a>, you can:</p>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Add Your Brand Logo:</strong> Place your company logo directly in the center of the QR code.</li>
        <li><strong>Match Your Brand Palette:</strong> Customize foreground and background gradients to match your corporate styling.</li>
        <li><strong>High-Resolution Vector Downloads:</strong> Export crisp PNG files ready for large billboards, window decals, or product packaging boxes.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>3 Ways to Maximize Your Channel Reach with This Update</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Pair Video Notes with Exclusive Drops:</strong> Announce that secret discount codes will be revealed only via Video Notes in your Channel to incentivize notification turn-ons.</li>
        <li><strong>Multi-Channel Cross Promotion:</strong> Share your Channel link across your TikTok, Instagram, and LinkedIn bios using our guide on <a href="/blog/whatsapp-channel-link-growth-guide">promoting WhatsApp Channel links</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Print QR Stickers for Retail Packages:</strong> Include a small card in every order: <em>"Scan this QR code to join our VIP Channel for product restock alerts."</em></li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

      <h3>Can followers reply to Video Notes in Channels?</h3>
      <p>Followers cannot reply with their own video or text (since Channels are one-way broadcasts), but they can tap any emoji reaction to show their support.</p>

      <h3>How long do updates stay visible in a WhatsApp Channel?</h3>
      <p>Channel updates remain in the channel feed for up to 30 days before being automatically archived by WhatsApp to keep feeds fast and clutter-free.</p>

